{"name": "Callsign: Stargazer", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5024450/extras/ad2207e26991a449c3b5c071c4820766.webp?t=1793755729\" width=\"400\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"432\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5024450/extras/918942c85ab2750dd7279b818a7f8d76.poster.avif?t=1793755729\" width=\"768\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5024450/extras/918942c85ab2750dd7279b818a7f8d76.webm?t=1793755729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5024450/extras/918942c85ab2750dd7279b818a7f8d76.mp4?t=1793755729\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mode-Switching Combat, alternate between &lt;&lt;Boost Mode&gt;&gt; disabling weapons to recover energy and </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&lt;&lt;Combat Mode&gt;&gt; to enable weapons but energy is drained. Combine tactical mastery with fast-paced action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5024450/extras/aed710caf7bb2fe219e04e34e194b393.webp?t=1793755729\" width=\"400\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"432\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5024450/extras/d7ada6c3cc7103b9adf34becacd0191c.poster.avif?t=1793755729\" width=\"768\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta